      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warrior_Run%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The historic Warrior Run Church hosts annual events like the Strawberry Festival and wine tastings, celebrating local heritage.",
